        {"q": "How much does an ER visit cost without insurance?", "a": "Without insurance, ER visit costs range from $150–3,000+ for the facility fee alone, depending on complexity level (CPT codes 99281–99285). Add physician fees, imaging, labs, and medications separately. A moderate ER visit (level 3–4) without insurance typically results in a total bill of $1,500–5,000. High-acuity visits or those requiring hospitalization can exceed $30,000."},
